---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const description =
  "Ikhsan is a senior software engineer in Jakarta with 10 years of building web products, currently building AI-assisted preconstruction features at Boon, fully remote.";
---

<Base title="About - Ikhsanuddin Syamsuri" description={description}>
  <main
    class="relative isolate overflow-hidden px-6 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:overflow-visible lg:px-0"
  >
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden blur-3xl">
      <svg
        class="absolute left-[max(50%,25rem)] top-0 h-[64rem] w-[128rem] -translate-x-1/2 stroke-gray-200 [mask-image:radial-gradient(64rem_64rem_at_top,white,transparent)]"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <defs>
          <pattern
            id="e813992c-7d03-4cc4-a2bd-151760b470a0"
            width="200"
            height="200"
            x="50%"
            y="-1"
            patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
          >
            <path d="M100 200V.5M.5 .5H200" fill="none"></path>
          </pattern>
        </defs>
        <svg x="50%" y="-1" class="overflow-visible fill-gray-50">
          <path
            d="M-100.5 0h201v201h-201Z M699.5 0h201v201h-201Z M499.5 400h201v201h-201Z M-300.5 600h201v201h-201Z"
            stroke-width="0"></path>
        </svg>
        <rect
          width="100%"
          height="100%"
          stroke-width="0"
          fill="url(#e813992c-7d03-4cc4-a2bd-151760b470a0)"></rect>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <section
      class="mx-auto grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-16 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start lg:gap-y-10"
    >
      <div
        class="lg:col-span-2 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-1 lg:mx-auto lg:grid lg:w-full lg:max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-x-8 lg:px-8"
      >
        <div class="lg:pr-4">
          <div class="lg:max-w-lg">
            <p class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-orange-600">
              Profile
            </p>
            <h1
              class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 sm:text-4xl"
            >
              Ikhsanuddin Syamsuri
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-8 dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-700">
              Ikhsan is a senior software engineer with 10 years of building
              web products. He works from Jakarta (UTC+7) and has worked fully
              remote with teams in Singapore and the US since 2023.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="-ml-12 -mt-12 -mr-12 lg:mr-0 p-12 lg:sticky lg:top-4 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-span-2 lg:row-start-1 lg:overflow-hidden"
      >
        <img
          src="https://ik.imagekit.io/ikhsanuddin/profile/ikhsanuddin?tr=w-912"
          alt="Ikhsanuddin Syamsuri"
          width="912"
          height="626"
          class="max-w-none rounded-xl bg-gray-900 shadow-xl ring-1 ring-gray-400/10 w-full"
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class="lg:col-span-2 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-2 lg:mx-auto lg:grid lg:w-full lg:max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-x-8 lg:px-8"
      >
        <div class="lg:pr-4">
          <div
            class="max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 lg:max-w-lg"
          >
            <p class="mb-8">
              At Boon he builds AI-assisted features for construction
              preconstruction, end to end in React and Ruby on Rails: document
              analysis, bid generation, guided onboarding for new Boon Agent
              users, and the trial funnel. He led Takeoff V2, the move of the
              blueprint canvas from a React component graph to a PixiJS/WebGL
              renderer with a spatial index and tiled rendering.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-8">
              His background in psychology shapes how he builds software: he
              cares about how people actually use what he ships, and he is
              comfortable with data research and statistical analysis.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-8">
              In 2012, he started in graphic design to help with tuition fees
              in psychology. That detour became a career: digital marketing,
              analytics, and SEO. Since 2016, software engineering full-time.
            </p>

            <ul class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <span>
                  <strong
                    class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100"
                  >
                    Frontend.
                  </strong>{" "}
                  React and TypeScript daily, PixiJS/WebGL for the blueprint
                  canvas at Boon. He has also shipped with Next.js, Vue/Nuxt,
                  Svelte, and React Native (ULO, 10,000+ downloads).
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <span>
                  <strong
                    class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100"
                  >
                    Backend.
                  </strong>{" "}
                  Ruby on Rails at Boon. Node.js and Go in production before
                  that, including 5 backend services in TypeScript and Go for a
                  decentralized exchange: GraphQL and REST APIs backed by
                  PostgreSQL, MongoDB, and Redis. Earlier in his career:
                  Nest.js, Laravel, and Java.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                <span>
                  <strong
                    class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100"
                  >
                    Devops.
                  </strong>{" "}
                  Docker and Kubernetes since 2021, infrastructure as code
                  with Terraform and Ansible, CI/CD on GitHub Actions, and AWS
                  in production.
                </span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <h2
              class="mt-16 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100"
            >
              Remote-first, across timezones.
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-6">
              Since 2023 he has worked fully remote with teams in Singapore
              and the US: async-first communication, clear written updates,
              and ownership of features from system design to deploy and
              monitoring.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section
      class="mx-auto grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-16 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start lg:gap-y-10"
    >
      <div
        class="lg:col-span-2 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-start-1 lg:mx-auto lg:grid lg:w-full lg:max-w-7xl lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-x-8 lg:px-8"
      >
        <ol class="border-l border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-500">
          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-3">
              <div
                class="-ml-[8px] mr-3 h-[15px] w-[15px] rounded-full bg-light-secondary dark:bg-dark-accent"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Present
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Boon</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                US (Remote)
              </p>
              <a
                class="text-orange-600"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                href="https://getboon.ai"
              >
                getboon.ai
              </a>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[5px] mr-3 h-[9px] w-[9px] rounded-full bg-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-500"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                February 2026
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-6 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h4 class="mb-1 mt-3 font-semibold">Full-Stack Engineer</h4>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                AI-assisted features for construction preconstruction, from
                document analysis to bid generation, on a takeoff system that
                handled 70,000+ takeoff runs in 90 days. Built the guided
                onboarding for new Boon Agent users and planned and measured
                the trial funnel.
              </p>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Led Takeoff V2, the move of the blueprint canvas to a
                PixiJS/WebGL renderer. In the prototype, on a page with 1,366
                annotations, click-to-select went from 591 ms to 1.9 ms.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[8px] mr-3 h-[15px] w-[15px] rounded-full bg-neutral-400"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                December 2025, left
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">
                Undercurrent Technologies Pte Ltd
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Singapore (Remote)
              </p>
              <a
                class="text-orange-600"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                href="https://undercurrent.tech"
              >
                undercurrent.tech
              </a>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[5px] mr-3 h-[9px] w-[9px] rounded-full bg-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-500"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                September 2023
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-6 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h4 class="mb-1 mt-3 font-semibold">Full-Stack Developer</h4>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Owned 5 backend services in TypeScript and Go for a
                decentralized exchange, built Telegram-based applications
                integrated with Web3 wallet services, and delivered Phaser.js
                game features as daily active users grew from 3,000 to 6,000.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-3">
              <div
                class="-ml-[8px] mr-3 h-[15px] w-[15px] rounded-full bg-neutral-400"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                April 2023, IT department disbanded
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">TwoSpaces</h3>
              <a
                class="text-orange-600"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                href="https://twospacesgroup.com"
              >
                twospacesgroup.com
              </a>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[5px] mr-3 h-[9px] w-[9px] rounded-full bg-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-500"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                April 2022
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-6 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h4 class="mb-1 mt-3 font-semibold">Technical Lead</h4>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Building digital property management services. Reservation,
                booking chart, payment, room service, email service, API
                integration with Channel Manager and digital check-in were
                built within a year.
              </p>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Led 2 junior engineers alongside 2 seniors: mentoring, code
                review, task distribution, and support. Moved deployments to
                zero-downtime CI/CD and services to Kubernetes on AWS, and
                rebuilt the website from Laravel to Next.js in 3 weeks.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[8px] mr-3 h-[15px] w-[15px] rounded-full bg-neutral-400"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                April 2022, left
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Tekno Kreasi Nyata</h3>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[5px] mr-3 h-[9px] w-[9px] rounded-full bg-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-500"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                May 2021
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h4 class="mb-1 mt-3 font-semibold">Technical Lead</h4>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Maintained development, gave level-3 support, and reported for
                a B2B white-label product with single-tenant software, managed
                in multi-tenant infrastructure using Kubernetes. The tools we
                used were Jira Agile, Google Cloud Platform, Stackdriver,
                Google Tag Manager and Google Analytics.
              </p>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Led a 14-person team and proposed moving a client's financial
                reporting system to Kafka and microservices, scaling it from
                5,000 to 100,000 incoming transactions per minute.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[5px] mr-3 h-[9px] w-[9px] rounded-full bg-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-500"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                April 2019
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4 mt-2 mb-3">
              <h4 class="mb-1 mt-3 font-semibold">Lead Frontend Engineer</h4>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                The frontend team got bigger, so he was promoted to lead the
                team. Deciding the stack for the next project and team capacity
                management became his responsibility. Leading 4 people.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[5px] mr-3 h-[9px] w-[9px] rounded-full bg-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-500"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                November 2018
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="ml-4 mt-2 mb-6">
              <h4 class="mb-1 mt-3 font-semibold">Senior Frontend Engineer</h4>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Developed websites using React.js with ANT-Design for back
                office and Vue/Nuxt.js for starting the project. He also
                mentored his colleagues.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[8px] mr-3 h-[15px] w-[15px] rounded-full bg-neutral-400"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                February 2019, left
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Coconutlab, Ltd</h3>
              <a
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-orange-600"
                href="https://coconutlab.io"
              >
                coconutlab.io
              </a>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[5px] mr-3 h-[9px] w-[9px] rounded-full bg-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-500"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Sept 2018
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-6 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h4 class="mb-1 mt-3 font-semibold">Senior Frontend Engineer</h4>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Built and shipped ULO (ulo.life), a production React Native
                mobile app with 10,000+ downloads.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[8px] mr-3 h-[15px] w-[15px] rounded-full bg-neutral-400"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Sept 2018, left
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">YAMISOK</h3>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[5px] mr-3 h-[9px] w-[9px] rounded-full bg-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-500"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                June 2017
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h4 class="mb-1 mt-3 font-semibold">Senior Frontend Engineer</h4>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Decided to follow the frontend path. He rebuilt the website
                using Vue.js and the new Bootstrap 4, and mentored 2 frontend
                engineers.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="flex-start flex items-center pt-2">
              <div
                class="-ml-[5px] mr-3 h-[9px] w-[9px] rounded-full bg-neutral-300 dark:bg-neutral-500"
              >
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                May 2016
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3 ml-4 mt-2">
              <h4 class="mb-1 mt-3 font-semibold">Junior Software Engineer</h4>
              <p class="mb-3 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-300">
                Translating Photoshop designs into HTML and CSS was his main
                job. Using Bootstrap 3, he created a gamer portal for online
                tournaments, used by 4,000 players, with upper and lower bracket
                systems, feeds,
                realtime chat, and marketing email. Sometimes he helped other
                colleagues with the Laravel backend.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
